    "\n请在该主机的连接设置中填写私钥口令后再连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nEnter the private key passphrase in this host's connection settings, then connect again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n请在该主机的连接设置中填写私钥口令后再连接。"
