    "AI 建议的命令可先插入终端自行确认；点「运行并分析」才会执行，并把结果发给 AI 继续判断。": {
      "comment": "Explanation of command approval in Assistant settings.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Insert AI-suggested commands into the terminal to review them first. They run only after you choose “Run & Analyze”; the result is then sent to AI for further analysis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 建议的命令可先插入终端自行确认；点「运行并分析」才会执行，并把结果发给 AI 继续判断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
