        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅取消本次操作，已发生的远端改动不会撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅回答，不执行命令": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers only · No command execution"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅回答，不执行命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在当前会话中使用输入的密码，不保存、不纳入同步；连接时可以选择保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The entered password is used only for the current session — it won't be saved or included in sync. You can choose to save it when connecting."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在当前会话中使用输入的密码，不保存、不纳入同步；连接时可以选择保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在部署成功后更新主机配置，下一次连接生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The host configuration is updated only after a successful deployment and takes effect on the next connection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在部署成功后更新主机配置，下一次连接生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅应用于这台主机，保存后生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies only to this host after saving."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅应用于这台主机，保存后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅影响新问题。重试沿用原问题的上下文；批准执行后仍会读取命令结果。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only affects new questions. Retrying reuses the original question's context; command results are still read after you approve execution."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅影响新问题。重试沿用原问题的上下文；批准执行后仍会读取命令结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅控制这台主机。默认开启；关闭后停止采集，不影响终端、文件和转发。此选项随主机配置同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies only to this host. Enabled by default. Turning it off stops monitoring without interrupting terminals, files, or forwarding. This option is synced with the host configuration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅控制这台主机。默认开启；关闭后停止采集，不影响终端、文件和转发。此选项随主机配置同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
