    },
    "各网卡速率相加；如有桥接或虚拟网卡，流量可能重复。": {
      "comment": "Used by MonitorPanel.swift.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rates from all interfaces are combined. Bridged or virtual interfaces may cause traffic to be counted more than once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各网卡速率相加；如有桥接或虚拟网卡，流量可能重复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合并不会同步删除。某项若只在另一台设备上存在，会重新带回本机。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merging never deletes. An item that exists only on another device will be brought back to this one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合并不会同步删除。某项若只在另一台设备上存在，会重新带回本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合并同步": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merge & Sync"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
