            "value": "同步完成，无变更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步尚未全部完成：主机配置与已保存密码已更新；密钥保存未完成，代码片段、端口转发和设置尚未应用。%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync is not fully complete: host configurations and saved passwords were updated; key saving did not finish, and snippets, port forwarding, and settings were not applied. %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步尚未全部完成：主机配置与已保存密码已更新；密钥保存未完成，代码片段、端口转发和设置尚未应用。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步范围包括主机、已保存的密码、密钥与私钥、片段、端口转发、AI 配置、参与同步的设置和设备信任记录。合并会保留两边独有项，不会同步删除。": {
      "comment": "Detailed explanation in the sync preview.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync includes hosts, saved passwords, keys and private keys, snippets, port forwarding, AI configuration, participating settings, and device trust records. Merging keeps items unique to either side and does not sync deletions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步范围包括主机、已保存的密码、密钥与私钥、片段、端口转发、AI 配置、参与同步的设置和设备信任记录。合并会保留两边独有项，不会同步删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步范围包括主机、已保存的密码、密钥与私钥、片段、端口转发和参与同步的设置。合并会保留两边独有项，不会同步删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync covers hosts, saved passwords, keys and private keys, snippets, port forwarding, and participating settings. Merging keeps items unique to each side and never deletes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步范围包括主机、已保存的密码、密钥与私钥、片段、端口转发和参与同步的设置。合并会保留两边独有项，不会同步删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步进行中，请在同步结束后保存主密码。": {
