    "将从此设备的密钥库删除“%@”及其私钥。使用它的主机需要重新选择登录凭据，服务器上的公钥不会被移除。此操作无法撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” and its private key will be deleted from the Key Library on this device. Hosts using it will need to select login credentials again; the public key on the server won't be removed. This action can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将从此设备的密钥库删除“%@”及其私钥。使用它的主机需要重新选择登录凭据，服务器上的公钥不会被移除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将停止其运行中的隧道并移除该规则，不可恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This stops its running tunnel and removes the rule. This can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将停止其运行中的隧道并移除该规则，不可恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将公钥添加到所选主机，授权密钥登录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add the public key to the selected host to authorize key login"
