    "建议使用 HTTPS；远程路径第一级目录需已存在（Seafile 需先在网页端新建资料库），深层目录会自动创建。密码存系统钥匙串，不写磁盘明文。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS is recommended. The first path segment must already exist (for Seafile, create a library in the web UI first); deeper folders are created automatically. The password is stored in the system Keychain, never in plaintext on disk."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建议使用 HTTPS；远程路径第一级目录需已存在（Seafile 需先在网页端新建资料库），深层目录会自动创建。密码存系统钥匙串，不写磁盘明文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
