    "此前记录的主机密钥与当前不一致。若你未重装服务器或更换密钥，请取消连接并核实，可能存在中间人攻击。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The previously recorded host key doesn't match the current one. If you haven't reinstalled the server or changed the key, cancel the connection and verify — there may be a man-in-the-middle attack."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
