    "留空时按安全默认顺序自动协商；指定算法后，仅允许该算法。编码只影响交互终端。": {
      "comment": "Used by AddHostView.swift.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave empty to negotiate using the secure default order. When an algorithm is selected, only that algorithm is allowed. Encoding affects interactive terminals only."
