    "该主机的证书与上次信任的不一致。若非你主动更换证书，可能存在中间人窃听风险，请谨慎确认。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This host's certificate does not match the one you previously trusted. If you didn't change it yourself, there may be a man-in-the-middle risk. Please confirm carefully."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该主机的证书与上次信任的不一致。若非你主动更换证书，可能存在中间人窃听风险，请谨慎确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该主机的配置（含保存的密码、会话历史、端口转发规则）将被删除，不可恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This host's configuration (including saved passwords, session history, and port forwarding rules) will be deleted permanently."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该主机的配置（含保存的密码、会话历史、端口转发规则）将被删除，不可恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该主机需要本次连接的密码。验证后即可查看 CPU、内存和网络状态。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This host requires a password for this connection. After verification you can view CPU, memory, and network status."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该主机需要本次连接的密码。验证后即可查看 CPU、内存和网络状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该文件在编辑器中有未保存的修改，标签未同步——保存仍会写到原文件名，建议先保存或关闭后再重命名。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file has unsaved changes in the editor and the tab is out of sync. Saving will still write to the original filename, so save or close it before renaming."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件在编辑器中有未保存的修改，标签未同步——保存仍会写到原文件名，建议先保存或关闭后再重命名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该文件将被永久删除，不可恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file will be deleted permanently."
          }
