          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件所在的目录在远端已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该文件自你打开后，已被其他程序或会话修改。「覆盖」会丢弃外部改动，「重新加载」会丢弃你未保存的修改。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file has been modified by another program or session since you opened it. \"Overwrite\" discards the external changes; \"Reload\" discards your unsaved changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件自你打开后，已被其他程序或会话修改。「覆盖」会丢弃外部改动，「重新加载」会丢弃你未保存的修改。"
          }
